{"args":{"command":"create-entity","data":{"body":"## What is wrong\n\nMeasured by adversary pass 1 on wave p1-14 unit p1-14-conformance (`review-result:p1-14-conformance-adversary-r1`, finding 3): setting the Propose and Validate command responses to `None` in the conformance target leaves all 36 generated scenarios passing. The unit reports, from reading the ESS 0.29.0 source, that the authored-scenario format cannot check a response, and a payload can map only from a top-level response field. So the lossless projection of `ProposalRecordV1` and `ValidationCommandResult` is not held by the suite.\n\n## What holds it today\n\n`crates/ekr/tests/adversary_p1_14_conformance.rs::proposal_responses_carry_the_exact_document_bytes`: an EKR test, outside the suite.\n\n## What closes this\n\nAn ESS capability for observing command responses in generated or authored scenarios, adopted by pinning that ESS version. This is an upstream question for the ESS repository.\n","status":"draft","title":"The conformance suite cannot observe Propose and Validate responses"},"entity_type":"aep.task/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/task/conformance-cannot-observe-command-responses"},"changed":{"body":"## What is wrong\n\nMeasured by adversary pass 1 on wave p1-14 unit p1-14-conformance (`review-result:p1-14-conformance-adversary-r1`, finding 3): setting the Propose and Validate command responses to `None` in the conformance target leaves all 36 generated scenarios passing. The unit reports, from reading the ESS 0.29.0 source, that the authored-scenario format cannot check a response, and a payload can map only from a top-level response field. So the lossless projection of `ProposalRecordV1` and `ValidationCommandResult` is not held by the suite.\n\n## What holds it today\n\n`crates/ekr/tests/adversary_p1_14_conformance.rs::proposal_responses_carry_the_exact_document_bytes`: an EKR test, outside the suite.\n\n## What closes this\n\nAn ESS capability for observing command responses in generated or authored scenarios, adopted by pinning that ESS version. This is an upstream question for the ESS repository.\n","title":"The conformance suite cannot observe Propose and Validate responses"},"entity":"task","entry_hash":"d039974348f2b58dbe15d249344c23d914a5556437618cbbdfb695ae329bff1a","from_state":null,"id":"conformance-cannot-observe-command-responses","parent_hash":"d6eb878637f8b5ab1f26e6a730728d2061839a7036746c2011e76caac4f104d4","payload":{"actor":"agent:claude-lazy-sutton-p1-14","at":1790195822383,"causation":"cmd-new-task-conformance-cannot-observe-command-responses","change":{"change":"created","status":"draft"},"correlation":"protocol-artifact-new","event_id":"task:conformance-cannot-observe-command-responses@1#0~cee0ae7b9c325cfa","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-23T20:37:02Z"},"revision":1,"to_state":"draft","type":"aep.entity.create/v1","version":1}